heck how `format_report` is invoked elsewhere before finalizing the file-writing approach, or if you want me to proceed with implementation.\n\n[tl: task=plan brief=clear level=easy shift=new size=s missing=none plan=made skill=unneeded prior=none check=none]"}]}}
